config DSU_PERMISSIVE
	tristate "First-stage AVB view handling with DSU-only SELinux permissive"
	depends on ARM64
	depends on BLOCK && PROC_FS && KPROBES && KALLSYMS && TRACEPOINTS
	help
	  During Android first-stage init, temporarily present PID 1 with an
	  AVB HashtreeDisabled view for the host system and DSU.  When the AOSP
	  DSU boot marker is present, also perform the existing one-time SELinux
	  permissive transition during selinux_setup.  No dm-verity table rewrite
	  is implemented.

	  Select Y for an in-tree early-init integration, or M only when an
	  init_boot loader is responsible for loading the matching GKI module.
